sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a SetDisplayMessageRequest with a endTime

    CSMS->>CS: SetDisplayMessageRequest (message.id, message.endDateTime)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message SetDisplayMessageRequest<br>- message.id <Generated Id><br>- message.endDateTime <Configured endDateTime>
    CS-->>CSMS: SetDisplayMessageResponse (status = Accepted)
